Package: Endemism
Type: Package
Title: Tree Endemism Across Tropical American Biomes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given   = "Guilherme",
           family  = "Grittz",
           role    = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email   = "ggrittz@usp.br",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6500-4422")))
Description: Research compendium for the paper "A biome lens is critical to
    understanding tree endemism across tropical America". Cleans herbarium
    records of tropical American trees, assigns them to biomes (IUCN EFGs),
    and maps weighted endemism and critical centers of endemism.
URL: https://github.com/ggrittz/Endemism
BugReports: https://github.com/ggrittz/Endemism/issues
